{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"绝对余极限"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"绝对余极限"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"范畴论","text":"范畴论"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>绝对余极限是被任何函子保持的"},{"Local":{"url":"余极限","text":"余极限"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>. 对于函子 $F\\colon I\\to\\mathcal C$ 下的余锥 $F\\to \\operatorname{const}X$, 如下条件等价:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>这个余极限是绝对余极限;</li>\n<li>这个余极限被"},{"Local":{"url":"米田嵌入","text":"米田嵌入"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal C \\to \\widehat {\\mathcal C}$ 保持.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<h3>共尾函子</h3>\n<p>设</p>\n"}]}}